                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Association shall be granted up to seventy-five (75) days of leave per fiscal year for use by its members. No one teacher may use more than five (5) of the above days per fiscal year. Additional leave shall be at the discretion of the Superintendent. If requested, the Association shall reimburse the Board for substitutes other than permanent substitutes, if said substitutes are required.",
            "block_bbox": [
                64,
